{
  "id": "EXO.27",
  "number": "27",
  "bookId": "EXO",
  "reference": "Exodus 27",
  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "27",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EXO 27"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "27",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And thou shalt make the altar of acacia wood, five cubits long, and five cubits broad; the altar shall be foursquare: and the height thereof shall be three cubits. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And thou shalt make the horns of it upon the four corners thereof; the horns thereof shall be of one piece with it: and thou shalt overlay it with brass. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And thou shalt make its pots to take away its ashes, and its shovels, and its basins, and its flesh-hooks, and its firepans: all the vessels thereof thou shalt make of brass. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And thou shalt make for it a grating of network of brass: and upon the net shalt thou make four brazen rings in the four corners thereof. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And thou shalt put it under the ledge round the altar beneath, that the net may reach halfway up the altar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And thou shalt make staves for the altar, staves of acacia wood, and overlay them with brass. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the staves thereof shall be put into the rings, and the staves shall be upon the two sides of the altar, in bearing it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hollow with planks shalt thou make it: as it hath been showed thee in the mount, so shall they make it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And thou shalt make the court of the tabernacle: for the south side southward there shall be hangings for the court of fine twined linen a hundred cubits long for one side: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and the pillars thereof shall be twenty, and their sockets twenty, of brass; the hooks of the pillars and their fillets ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " of silver. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And likewise for the north side in length there shall be hangings a hundred cubits long, and the pillars thereof twenty, and their sockets twenty, of brass; the hooks of the pillars, and their fillets, of silver. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And for the breadth of the court on the west side shall be hangings of fifty cubits; their pillars ten, and their sockets ten. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the breadth of the court on the east side eastward shall be fifty cubits. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The hangings for the one side ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " shall be fifteen cubits; their pillars three, and their sockets three. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And for the other side shall be hangings of fifteen cubits; their pillars three, and their sockets three. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And for the gate of the court shall be a screen of twenty cubits, of blue, and purple, and scarlet, and fine twined linen, the work of the embroiderer; their pillars four, and their sockets four. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All the pillars of the court round about shall be filleted with silver; their hooks of silver, and their sockets of brass. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The length of the court shall be a hundred cubits, and the breadth fifty every where, and the height five cubits, of fine twined linen, and their sockets of brass. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All the instruments of the tabernacle in all the service thereof, and all the pins thereof, and all the pins of the court, shall be of brass.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And thou shalt command the children of Israel, that they bring unto thee pure olive oil beaten for the light, to cause a lamp to burn continually. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the tent of meeting, without the veil which is before the testimony, Aaron and his sons shall keep it in order from evening to morning before Jehovah: it shall be a statute for ever throughout their generations on the behalf of the children of Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
